// Every Time Intelligence item against every Scenario Comparison item (40 combinations) for one real cell: the
// Department for Education (DFE022) in 2020-21, resource DEL, from OSCAR Plans (grain A). The cell has a previous year
// (2019-20), no period 0, and a plan at the grain of the cell. What the combinations must do:
//   - YTD and Current at the whole year give the year; the plan is present, so Variance, Variance % and
//     Favourable/Adverse are present; PY moves the year, the plan and the variance back one year;
//   - MTD, QTD and Rolling 12 months are windows below the grain of a plan: Actual shows, Plan and everything that
//     needs it is BLANK;
//   - YoY and YoY % are differences of Actual, Plan and Variance, and are BLANK for Variance % and Favourable/Adverse
//     (a difference of two ratios or two indicators means nothing).
// Variance % and YoY % are shown in parts per million.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Time Intelligence'[Time Calculation],
    'Scenario Comparison'[Comparison],
    TREATAS ( { "2020-21" }, 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year] ),
    TREATAS ( { "DFE022" }, 'Organisation (as reported)'[Organisation Code] ),
    TREATAS ( { "RDEL" }, 'Fact Plan'[Plan Measure] ),
    "value",
        IF (
            SELECTEDVALUE ( 'Scenario Comparison'[Comparison] ) = "Variance %"
                || SELECTEDVALUE ( 'Time Intelligence'[Time Calculation] ) = "YoY %",
            [Comparison Amount] * 1000000,
            [Comparison Amount]
        )
)
